        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Dear Dr. Salma,  A new leave request has been submitted and is waiting for your review.  Employee: {{ $('Get a row').item.json.full_name }} is requesting a Leave type: {{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.leave_type }} From: {{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.start_date }} To:{{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.end_date }}  Number of days: {{ $('Validate request').item.json.days }} Employee note: {{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.employee_note }} Request ID: {{ $('Create a row').item.json.leave_request_id }} Status: Pending  Please review and approve or reject this request.  Best regards, MedFlow HR Assistant",
